// Page InstructorIntro Text :
"P2797016975" "<color deepskyblue>Mission Architect Instructor</color><br><br>Hi, {HeroName}. I'm here to help you through the various elements of the Mission Architect.<br><br>Is there anything specific I can help you out with?"
// Answer Text :
"P715159366" "Basic Walkthrough"
// Answer Text :
"P2377323874" "Creating Arcs"
// Answer Text :
"P691388963" "Terminology"
// Answer Text :
"P20955533" "Playing Arcs"
// Answer Text :
"P565503448" "Rating Arcs"
// Answer Text :
"P1683555424" "Publishing Arcs"
// Answer Text :
"P2405511154" "Architect Rewards"
// Answer Text :
"P1479007065" "Custom Character Creation"
